<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<fmxmlsnippet type="FMObjectList">
<Step enable="True" id="89" name="# (comment)">
<Text>PURPOSE: Find-or-create an Artikal by šifra, then add a StavkaPrimke line to a Primka (create mode) or set the artikal on an existing line (assign mode — phone scan flow). Pure SQL — no layout hops.</Text>
</Step>
<Step enable="False" id="61" name="Insert Text">
<SelectAll state="False"/>
<Text>PARAMS: sifra (text, required — product code from barcode or manual entry; uppercased before lookup)&#xD;  primkaID (text — create mode: a new StavkaPrimke line is added to this Primka)&#xD;  stavkaID (text — assign mode: set the resolved artikal on this existing StavkePrimke line; wins over primkaID)&#xD;  kolicina (number, optional — initial quantity for the new line; create mode only)&#xD;&#xD;RETURNS: data.artikalID, data.artikalCreated (bool), data.stavkaID, data.stavkaCreated (bool)&#xD;&#xD;NOTES: Artikal lookup is UPPER-matched because FQL comparisons are case-sensitive while the original Perform Find was not. A newly created Artikal carries only the šifra — naziv and cijene are filled in later, matching the original flow.&#xD;&#xD;REPLACES: Unesi Artikal (531) = create mode; Unesi Artikal phone (644) = assign mode.</Text>
<Field>$README</Field>
</Step>
<Step enable="False" id="141" name="Set Variable">
<Name>$example_createMode</Name>
<Value><Calculation><![CDATA[JSONSetElement ( "{}" ;
	[ "sifra" ; "ABC-123" ; JSONString ] ;
	[ "primkaID" ; Primke::PrimaryKey ; JSONString ] ;
	[ "kolicina" ; 5 ; JSONNumber ]
)]]></Calculation></Value>
</Step>
<Step enable="False" id="141" name="Set Variable">
<Name>$example_assignMode</Name>
<Value><Calculation><![CDATA[JSONSetElement ( "{}" ;
	[ "sifra" ; "ABC-123" ; JSONString ] ;
	[ "stavkaID" ; StavkePrimke::PrimaryKey ; JSONString ]
)]]></Calculation></Value>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="89" name="# (comment)"/>
<Step enable="True" id="85" name="Allow User Abort">
<Set state="False"/>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="86" name="Set Error Capture">
<Set state="True"/>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="141" name="Set Variable">
<Name>$void</Name>
<Value><Calculation><![CDATA[Params.parse ( Get ( ScriptParameter ) ; "sifra|primkaID|stavkaID|kolicina" )]]></Calculation></Value>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="141" name="Set Variable">
<Name>$void</Name>
<Value><Calculation><![CDATA[Response_Init ( "{}" )]]></Calculation></Value>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="141" name="Set Variable">
<Name>$void</Name>
<Value><Calculation><![CDATA[Log.add ( "info" ; "ORD_ADD_ARTICLE_START" ; "Adding artikal sifra " & $sifra & If ( IsEmpty ( $stavkaID ) ; " to primka " & $primkaID ; " onto stavka " & $stavkaID ) ; $params )]]></Calculation></Value>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="89" name="# (comment)"/>
<Step enable="False" id="89" name="# (comment)">
<Text>MARK: Validate</Text>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="141" name="Set Variable">
<Name>$sifra</Name>
<Value><Calculation><![CDATA[Upper ( Trim ( $sifra ) )]]></Calculation></Value>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="68" name="If">
<Calculation><![CDATA[IsEmpty ( $sifra )]]></Calculation>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="141" name="Set Variable">
<Name>$void</Name>
<Value><Calculation><![CDATA[Response_AddError ( "MISSING_PARAM" ; "sifra is required" ; "sifra" ; "{}" ; "" )]]></Calculation></Value>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="70" name="End If"/>
<Step enable="True" id="68" name="If">
<Calculation><![CDATA[IsEmpty ( $primkaID ) and IsEmpty ( $stavkaID )]]></Calculation>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="141" name="Set Variable">
<Name>$void</Name>
<Value><Calculation><![CDATA[Response_AddError ( "MISSING_PARAM" ; "primkaID (create mode) or stavkaID (assign mode) is required" ; "primkaID" ; "{}" ; "" )]]></Calculation></Value>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="70" name="End If"/>
<Step enable="True" id="89" name="# (comment)">
<Text>Verify the target exists BEFORE the artikal find-or-create, so a bad ID cannot leave an orphan Artikal behind.</Text>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="68" name="If">
<Calculation><![CDATA[not IsEmpty ( $stavkaID )]]></Calculation>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="141" name="Set Variable">
<Name>$selSt</Name>
<Value><Calculation><![CDATA[epSQLExecute (
	"SELECT \"PrimaryKey\" FROM \"StavkePrimke\" WHERE \"PrimaryKey\" = ?" ;
	"useSQLResult=st" ;
	$stavkaID
)]]></Calculation></Value>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="68" name="If">
<Calculation><![CDATA[not IsEmpty ( $selSt ) or epSQLResultRowCount ( "st" ) = 0]]></Calculation>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="141" name="Set Variable">
<Name>$void</Name>
<Value><Calculation><![CDATA[Response_AddError ( "NOT_FOUND_STAVKA" ; "StavkaPrimke not found: " & $stavkaID ; "stavkaID" ; $params ; "" )]]></Calculation></Value>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="70" name="End If"/>
<Step enable="True" id="141" name="Set Variable">
<Name>$void</Name>
<Value><Calculation><![CDATA[epSQLResultDelete ( "st" )]]></Calculation></Value>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="125" name="Else If">
<Calculation><![CDATA[not IsEmpty ( $primkaID )]]></Calculation>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="141" name="Set Variable">
<Name>$selPr</Name>
<Value><Calculation><![CDATA[epSQLExecute (
	"SELECT \"PrimaryKey\" FROM \"Primke\" WHERE \"PrimaryKey\" = ?" ;
	"useSQLResult=prim" ;
	$primkaID
)]]></Calculation></Value>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="68" name="If">
<Calculation><![CDATA[not IsEmpty ( $selPr ) or epSQLResultRowCount ( "prim" ) = 0]]></Calculation>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="141" name="Set Variable">
<Name>$void</Name>
<Value><Calculation><![CDATA[Response_AddError ( "NOT_FOUND_PRIMKA" ; "Primka not found: " & $primkaID ; "primkaID" ; $params ; "" )]]></Calculation></Value>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="70" name="End If"/>
<Step enable="True" id="141" name="Set Variable">
<Name>$void</Name>
<Value><Calculation><![CDATA[epSQLResultDelete ( "prim" )]]></Calculation></Value>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="70" name="End If"/>
<Step enable="True" id="68" name="If">
<Calculation><![CDATA[Response_HasErrors ( $response )]]></Calculation>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="68" name="If">
<Calculation><![CDATA[$isRoot]]></Calculation>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="1" name="Perform Script">
<Calculation><![CDATA[JSONSetElement ( "{}" ; "traceID" ; $traceID ; JSONString )]]></Calculation>
<Script id="780" name="UTIL__FlushLog"/>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="70" name="End If"/>
<Step enable="True" id="103" name="Exit Script">
<Calculation><![CDATA[Response_Finalize]]></Calculation>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="70" name="End If"/>
<Step enable="True" id="89" name="# (comment)"/>
<Step enable="False" id="89" name="# (comment)">
<Text>MARK: FindOrCreateArtikal</Text>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="141" name="Set Variable">
<Name>$selArt</Name>
<Value><Calculation><![CDATA[epSQLExecute (
	"SELECT \"PrimaryKey\" FROM \"Artikli\" WHERE UPPER ( \"SifraArtikla\" ) = ?" ;
	"useSQLResult=art" ;
	$sifra
)]]></Calculation></Value>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="68" name="If">
<Calculation><![CDATA[not IsEmpty ( $selArt )]]></Calculation>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="141" name="Set Variable">
<Name>$void</Name>
<Value><Calculation><![CDATA[epSQLResultDelete ( "art" )]]></Calculation></Value>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="141" name="Set Variable">
<Name>$void</Name>
<Value><Calculation><![CDATA[Response_AddError ( "SQL_ERROR" ; "Artikli lookup failed: " & $selArt ; "" ; $params ; "" )]]></Calculation></Value>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="125" name="Else If">
<Calculation><![CDATA[epSQLResultRowCount ( "art" ) > 0]]></Calculation>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="141" name="Set Variable">
<Name>$artikalID</Name>
<Value><Calculation><![CDATA[epSQLResult ( 0 ; 0 ; "art" )]]></Calculation></Value>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="141" name="Set Variable">
<Name>$artikalCreated</Name>
<Value><Calculation><![CDATA[False]]></Calculation></Value>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="141" name="Set Variable">
<Name>$void</Name>
<Value><Calculation><![CDATA[epSQLResultDelete ( "art" )]]></Calculation></Value>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="69" name="Else"/>
<Step enable="True" id="141" name="Set Variable">
<Name>$void</Name>
<Value><Calculation><![CDATA[epSQLResultDelete ( "art" )]]></Calculation></Value>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="141" name="Set Variable">
<Name>$artikalID</Name>
<Value><Calculation><![CDATA[UUIDv7]]></Calculation></Value>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="141" name="Set Variable">
<Name>$ins</Name>
<Value><Calculation><![CDATA[epSQLExecute (
	"INSERT INTO \"Artikli\" (\"PrimaryKey\", \"SifraArtikla\") VALUES (?, ?)" ;
	"" ;
	$artikalID ;
	$sifra
)]]></Calculation></Value>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="68" name="If">
<Calculation><![CDATA[not IsEmpty ( $ins )]]></Calculation>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="141" name="Set Variable">
<Name>$void</Name>
<Value><Calculation><![CDATA[Response_AddError ( "INSERT_FAILED" ; "Failed to create Artikal for sifra " & $sifra & " (" & $ins & ")" ; "sifra" ; $params ; "" )]]></Calculation></Value>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="69" name="Else"/>
<Step enable="True" id="141" name="Set Variable">
<Name>$artikalCreated</Name>
<Value><Calculation><![CDATA[True]]></Calculation></Value>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="70" name="End If"/>
<Step enable="True" id="70" name="End If"/>
<Step enable="True" id="68" name="If">
<Calculation><![CDATA[Response_HasErrors ( $response )]]></Calculation>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="68" name="If">
<Calculation><![CDATA[$isRoot]]></Calculation>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="1" name="Perform Script">
<Calculation><![CDATA[JSONSetElement ( "{}" ; "traceID" ; $traceID ; JSONString )]]></Calculation>
<Script id="780" name="UTIL__FlushLog"/>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="70" name="End If"/>
<Step enable="True" id="103" name="Exit Script">
<Calculation><![CDATA[Response_Finalize]]></Calculation>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="70" name="End If"/>
<Step enable="True" id="89" name="# (comment)"/>
<Step enable="False" id="89" name="# (comment)">
<Text>MARK: CreateOrAssignLine</Text>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="68" name="If">
<Calculation><![CDATA[not IsEmpty ( $stavkaID )]]></Calculation>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="89" name="# (comment)">
<Text>Assign mode — set the artikal on the existing line (phone scan flow). Existence already verified.</Text>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="141" name="Set Variable">
<Name>$upd</Name>
<Value><Calculation><![CDATA[epSQLExecute (
	"UPDATE \"StavkePrimke\" SET \"ForeignKeyArtikalID\" = ? WHERE \"PrimaryKey\" = ?" ;
	"" ;
	$artikalID ;
	$stavkaID
)]]></Calculation></Value>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="68" name="If">
<Calculation><![CDATA[not IsEmpty ( $upd )]]></Calculation>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="141" name="Set Variable">
<Name>$void</Name>
<Value><Calculation><![CDATA[Response_AddError ( "UPDATE_FAILED" ; "Failed to set artikal on stavka " & $stavkaID & " (" & $upd & ")" ; "stavkaID" ; $params ; "" )]]></Calculation></Value>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="69" name="Else"/>
<Step enable="True" id="141" name="Set Variable">
<Name>$stavkaOutID</Name>
<Value><Calculation><![CDATA[$stavkaID]]></Calculation></Value>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="141" name="Set Variable">
<Name>$stavkaCreated</Name>
<Value><Calculation><![CDATA[False]]></Calculation></Value>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="70" name="End If"/>
<Step enable="True" id="69" name="Else"/>
<Step enable="True" id="89" name="# (comment)">
<Text>Create mode — insert a new line on the Primka (desktop add flow). Existence already verified.</Text>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="141" name="Set Variable">
<Name>$stavkaOutID</Name>
<Value><Calculation><![CDATA[UUIDv7]]></Calculation></Value>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="68" name="If">
<Calculation><![CDATA[IsEmpty ( $kolicina )]]></Calculation>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="141" name="Set Variable">
<Name>$ins</Name>
<Value><Calculation><![CDATA[epSQLExecute (
	"INSERT INTO \"StavkePrimke\" (\"PrimaryKey\", \"ForeignKeyPrimkaID\", \"ForeignKeyArtikalID\") VALUES (?, ?, ?)" ;
	"" ;
	$stavkaOutID ;
	$primkaID ;
	$artikalID
)]]></Calculation></Value>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="69" name="Else"/>
<Step enable="True" id="141" name="Set Variable">
<Name>$ins</Name>
<Value><Calculation><![CDATA[epSQLExecute (
	"INSERT INTO \"StavkePrimke\" (\"PrimaryKey\", \"ForeignKeyPrimkaID\", \"ForeignKeyArtikalID\", \"Kolicina\") VALUES (?, ?, ?, ?)" ;
	"" ;
	$stavkaOutID ;
	$primkaID ;
	$artikalID ;
	GetAsNumber ( $kolicina )
)]]></Calculation></Value>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="70" name="End If"/>
<Step enable="True" id="68" name="If">
<Calculation><![CDATA[not IsEmpty ( $ins )]]></Calculation>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="141" name="Set Variable">
<Name>$void</Name>
<Value><Calculation><![CDATA[Response_AddError ( "INSERT_FAILED" ; "Failed to create StavkaPrimke on primka " & $primkaID & " (" & $ins & ")" ; "primkaID" ; $params ; "" )]]></Calculation></Value>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="69" name="Else"/>
<Step enable="True" id="141" name="Set Variable">
<Name>$stavkaCreated</Name>
<Value><Calculation><![CDATA[True]]></Calculation></Value>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="70" name="End If"/>
<Step enable="True" id="70" name="End If"/>
<Step enable="True" id="89" name="# (comment)"/>
<Step enable="False" id="89" name="# (comment)">
<Text>MARK: Result</Text>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="68" name="If">
<Calculation><![CDATA[not Response_HasErrors ( $response )]]></Calculation>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="141" name="Set Variable">
<Name>$void</Name>
<Value><Calculation><![CDATA[Response_SetData ( JSONSetElement ( "{}" ;
	[ "artikalID" ; $artikalID ; JSONString ] ;
	[ "artikalCreated" ; $artikalCreated ; JSONBoolean ] ;
	[ "stavkaID" ; $stavkaOutID ; JSONString ] ;
	[ "stavkaCreated" ; $stavkaCreated ; JSONBoolean ]
) )]]></Calculation></Value>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="141" name="Set Variable">
<Name>$void</Name>
<Value><Calculation><![CDATA[Log.add ( "info" ; "ORD_ADD_ARTICLE_DONE" ; "Artikal " & $artikalID & If ( $artikalCreated ; " (created)" ; "" ) & " on stavka " & $stavkaOutID & If ( $stavkaCreated ; " (new line)" ; " (assigned)" ) ; $params )]]></Calculation></Value>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="70" name="End If"/>
<Step enable="True" id="68" name="If">
<Calculation><![CDATA[$isRoot]]></Calculation>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="1" name="Perform Script">
<Calculation><![CDATA[JSONSetElement ( "{}" ; "traceID" ; $traceID ; JSONString )]]></Calculation>
<Script id="780" name="UTIL__FlushLog"/>
</Step>
<Step enable="True" id="70" name="End If"/>
<Step enable="True" id="103" name="Exit Script">
<Calculation><![CDATA[Response_Finalize]]></Calculation>
</Step>
</fmxmlsnippet>
